    "nextExpectedAt": 1793558472113
  }
}
```

Lists the most effective attack or defense teams of a season. Results are paginated: follow `pagination.nextCursor` while `pagination.hasMore` is `true`.

**Parameters**

- `season`: The season number.
- `role`: `attack` or `defense`.
- `minimumBattles`: Only teams with at least this many recorded battles. Defaults to 10.
- `sort`: `confidence` (default), `winRateDesc`, `winRateAsc` or `battles`.
- `exclude`: Comma-separated student ids; teams with any of them are left out.
- `limit`: Page size, 1–100. Defaults to 50.
- `cursor`: The `pagination.nextCursor` of the previous page.

